      "section_id": "SEC_001",
      "section_type": "INCLUSION_CRITERIA",
      "heading": "Inclusion Criteria",
      "text": "1. Histologically or cytologically confirmed non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC) Stage IV.\n2. Patient must be aged >= 18 years and have an ECOG performance status <= 1 at time of screening.\n3. Absolute neutrophil count (ANC) >= 1.5 x 10^9/L.\n4. Patient has adequate organ and marrow reserve in the opinion of the investigator.\n5. Left ventricular ejection fraction (LVEF) >= 50% only in patients with prior cumulative doxorubicin exposure > 300 mg/m2; otherwise baseline cardiac evaluation not required.",
